sequenceDiagram
    participant User as External User
    participant PRoute as OpenShift Route<br/>(planner)<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant BRoute as OpenShift Route<br/>(planner-backend)<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL 16<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Ollama as Ollama Server<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtLLM as External LLM Provider<br/>(OpenAI / Vertex AI)<br/>HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>HTTPS

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 1: Interactive Planning via UI

    User->>PRoute: GET / (HTTPS, TLS Edge)
    PRoute->>UI: Forward (HTTP :8501)
    UI-->>PRoute: Streamlit App
    PRoute-->>User: HTML/JS Response

    User->>PRoute: Planning Request via UI
    PRoute->>UI: Forward (HTTP :8501)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/calculate<br/>HTTP :8000 (plaintext)
    Backend->>Postgres: Query benchmark data<br/>PostgreSQL :5432 (password auth)
    Postgres-->>Backend: Benchmark results
    Backend->>Ollama: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP :11434 (plaintext)
    Note over Ollama: Granite 3.3 2b<br/>GPU inference
    Ollama-->>Backend: LLM Response
    Backend-->>UI: Capacity Plan JSON
    UI-->>PRoute: Rendered Results
    PRoute-->>User: Planning Results

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 2: Direct API - Model Recommendation

    User->>BRoute: POST /api/v1/recommend<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    BRoute->>Backend: Forward (HTTP :8000)
    Backend->>HFHub: GET model metadata<br/>HTTPS (Bearer HF_TOKEN)
    HFHub-->>Backend: Model Info
    Backend->>ExtLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS (API Key)
    ExtLLM-->>Backend: Recommendation
    Backend-->>BRoute: Recommendation JSON
    BRoute-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 3: Deploy Model to Cluster

    User->>BRoute: POST /api/v1/deploy-to-cluster<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    BRoute->>Backend: Forward (HTTP :8000)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: GET /api/v1/nodes<br/>HTTPS :6443 (ServiceAccount)
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Node list (GPU info)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService CR<br/>HTTPS :6443 (ServiceAccount)
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Created
    Backend->>Postgres: INSERT deployment record<br/>PostgreSQL :5432
    Postgres-->>Backend: Stored
    Backend-->>BRoute: Deployment Status JSON
    BRoute-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 4: Database Admin Operations

    User->>BRoute: POST /api/v1/db/upload-benchmarks<br/>HTTPS TLS Edge
    BRoute->>Backend: Forward (HTTP :8000)
    Note over Backend: DB_ADMIN_PASSWORD check<br/>(optional gate)
    Backend->>Postgres: INSERT benchmark data<br/>PostgreSQL :5432
    Postgres-->>Backend: Stored
    Backend-->>BRoute: Upload Result
    BRoute-->>User: HTTPS Response
